N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks).
N:v2: at the three section ends before "Graam-chhaa-raa" (sthayi, antara, end), "re" of "bhu-lay re" is one note
N:earlier, on the R, as the swaralipi (SNLTR) has it; elsewhere it stays on the S, as there.
N:Syllables placed on the notes as in the swaralipi (Sa = C); one swaralipi matra = one quarter note.
N:The refrain "Aamar mon bhulay re" and "mori haay haay re" are sung as in the swaralipi;
N:the lyrics file leaves them out.
